# headwear/helm/morion_legend: the MORION family grown at T5-T6
# (HELMS wave 2, round 1; PLAN D44 D68, STYLE_P2 29.4 / 29.10) the T5-T6 growth of the helm family `fam.morion` on a culture
# alloy, drawn from the helm's own crown mark (placed on the head anchor at each variant's mark), so every variant keeps its outline and grows from its own
# crown: T5 a feather plume over the comb; T6 the plume between heraldic gilt wings.
# Written by the HELMS area tools/grow.py from src/designs.py (D and R drawn; U is D; L is R mirrored and re-lit; lie = L).
# The `!crest-<v>` terms step aside for the crests drawn on this family: a drawn crest grows itself (helm/crest/*.pxm).
use person
body adult
role helm fam.morion
layer headwear
anchor head
keys hatpose
z 1
tags overlay
legend X glow 3
legend W glow 4
legend J metal2 0
legend Q metal2 4
legend F plume 0
legend R plume 1
legend S plume 2
legend T plume 3
legend U plume 4
# (P5b SIG C2) begin legend: the characters of this script's views in this map
legend À dye 1
legend Á dye 2
legend Â dye 3
legend Ã dye 4
legend Ä dye2 1
legend Å dye2 2
legend Æ dye2 3
legend Ç dye2 4
legend È metal2 1
legend É metal2 2
legend Ê metal2 3
# (P5b SIG C2) end legend
# (P5b SIG C2) begin river-t5-plume: the River T5 plume: linen over lapis, curling back from a gilt socket behind the comb (stirs)
